description:
200 to 400 metres long; several delta wings joined by structure; no lights or engines; 
moved from 7 to 15 miles away in ~10 secs through ~15 degrees of arc; silent; flew behind cloud base; 
Dark brown/black colour; preceeded by something going up and down our road at ~100 mph.
Witness elects to remain totally anonymous; provides no contact information.  PD
